<title>UK: Ontario sets A$125 mln five-year discount bond.</title>
<headline>Ontario sets A$125 mln five-year discount bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following discount bond was</p>
<p>announced by lead manager Daiwa Europe.</p>
<p> BORROWER   ONTARIO</p>
<p> AMT	  A$125 MLN COUPON     5.00	MATURITY    15.OCT.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  89.22     PAY DATE    15.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.25	LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA3/AA-   DENOMS (K) 1	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/CA/AU</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ONTARIO   HOME CTRY  CANADA    TAX PROVS   GROSS-UP</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  0.125     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
